\title{modelterms7: Model Terms as Objects for Formula-Based Modeling}
\description{
Model terms as 'S7' objects: the mapping from a data frame to a design-matrix block, the penalty attached to the block's coefficients, and the metadata a fit reads, with a formula interpreter that recognizes term constructors by what they return rather than by name, so user-defined terms work in formulas without registration. Includes the unpenalized parametric term and the censored-response constructor. Part of the 'statmodels7' toolkit.
